And that comes over to us automatically.

44:36.840 --> 44:38.640
Otherwise, it would be a nightmare.

44:38.640 --> 44:41.600
Like there would be literally no way.

44:46.760 --> 44:48.280
Yeah, that's an interesting question.

44:48.280 --> 44:52.360
I mean, maybe you could game the system

44:52.360 --> 44:56.860
by faking some of your FEC filings, although I doubt it.

44:57.620 --> 45:02.620
So the colors are key to the candidate.

